{"title":"Saturday Salsa Matinee | Toronto","startsAt":"2026-10-31T14:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-31T18:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Best way to get a hold of us is on our [WhatsApp chat](https://chat.whatsapp.com/KpFOsXEuXRWB7uOYorJNPU), also great way to join a community of amazing like-minded people :)\n\nAdmission includes:\n1-Hour Salsa Lesson\nSocial Dancing - DJ Geronimo's top Salsa, Bachata & Cha cha Latin hits.\n\nIt's an excellent opportunity to practice and improve your dance to the tunes of world Salsa music by DJ Geronimo and guest DJs. Have a favourite song ? We're also accepting music requests\nAtmosphere: Friendly and Laid back.\n\nDancers of all levels are welcome for social (No partner required)\nDoor: $10\n\nFREE LESSON (with admission to social dancing) 2pm\n\nSOCIAL DANCING 3-6pm\n\\*Please check calendar as in some rare occasions time changes slightly\n\nVenue: Tempo Dance Collective – 1610a Bloor St W, Toronto\n\nEveryone is welcome!\nJoin our WhatsApp group:\n[https://chat.whatsapp.com/Kj63TzHIqYL5hPrRJolhyD](https://chat.whatsapp.com/KpFOsXEuXRWB7uOYorJNPU)\n\nHosts:\n\nMaya & Gary\nCanada SBK (Formerly TSF)","venue":{"name":"Tempo Dance Collective","address":"1610A Bloor St W, Toronto, ON M6P 1A7, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.655866,"lng":-79.455317,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":{"amount":10,"currency":"CAD"},"group":"Salsa | Bachata | Kizomba GTA","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/e/7/d/9/highres_536399353.jpeg"}